    "title": "TACO: Trash Annotations in Context Dataset",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.3587843",
    "publication_date": "2019-06-09",
    "description": "<p>TACO is a growing image dataset of trash in the wild. It contains segmented images of litter taken under diverse environments: woods, roads and beaches. These images are manually labeled according to an hierarchical taxonomy to train and evaluate object detection algorithms.&nbsp;Annotations are provided in a similar&nbsp;format to COCO dataset.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, go to:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/pedropro/TACO\">http://t</a><a href=\"http://tacodataset.org\">acodataset.org</a></p>",
